" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inhuman Horrors</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What horrors lurk deep within the labs of the nefarious Valravn research facilities? Renowned for weaponizing the anomalous, Valravn will bring all manner of unearthly terrors to bear. Adapt to new dangers, or become their prey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707670/extras/efa66e66bd59305889034ca16dca7069.poster.avif?t=1752560568\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707670/extras/efa66e66bd59305889034ca16dca7069.webm?t=1752560568\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2707670/extras/efa66e66bd59305889034ca16dca7069.mp4?t=1752560568\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Enter the Depths of Horror</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a full story campaign, <i>SCP: Valravn</i> will take you through Leena\u2019s harrowing journey through the darkest fringe of the secretive underworld. Featuring a story from the original Valravn author, Kilerpoyo. Uncover mad gods, murderous AI, and secrets that will shape your destiny. That which is hidden will be brought to light.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>You never lose a war, when war is what you sell.</i></u></p>",
